1. question="People's Socialist Republic of Albania >> member of"; answer='Warsaw Pact'; support_paragraph=0
2. question='Which nation was in effective control of both political and military functions of #1 ?'; answer='the USSR'; support_paragraph=8
3. question='Exercise Reforger >> participant'; answer='NATO'; support_paragraph=1
4. question='when did the #2 agree to a unified germany inside of #3'; answer='May 1990'; support_paragraph=15

